{"path":"experimental/ostream_joiner","title":"std::experimental::ostream_joiner","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::</span>ostream_joiner","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/ostream_joiner","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"std::experimental::ostream_joiner is a single-pass LegacyOutputIterator that writes successive objects into the std::basic_ostream object for which it was constructed, using operator<<, separated by a delimiter.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code>&lt;experimental/iterator&gt;</code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-libfund_ts_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> DelimT,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> CharT <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span>,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Traits <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/char_traits\"><span class=\"kw1275\">std::<span class=\"me2\">char_traits</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">class</span> ostream_joiner<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-libfund-ts-2 t-mark-ts\">(library fundamentals TS v2)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>std::experimental::ostream_joiner</code> is a single-pass <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/OutputIterator\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">LegacyOutputIterator</em></a> that writes successive objects into the <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\">std::basic_ostream</a></span> object for which it was constructed, using <code>operator&lt;&lt;</code>, separated by a delimiter. The delimiter is written to the output stream between every two objects that are written. The write operation is performed when the iterator (whether dereferenced or not) is assigned to. Incrementing the <code>ostream_joiner</code> is a no-op.\n</p><p>In a typical implementation, the only data members of <code>ostream_joiner</code> are a pointer to the associated <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\">std::basic_ostream</a></span>, the delimiter, and a <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span></span> member that indicates whether the next write is for the first element in the sequence.\n</p><p>Compared to <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/ostream_iterator\">std::ostream_iterator</a></span>, <code>ostream_joiner</code> prints the delimiter sequence one fewer time, and is not templated on the type of the object to be printed.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Member_types\">Member types</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td> Member type\n</td>\n<td> Definition\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>char_type</code>\n</td>\n<td> <code>CharT</code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>traits_type</code>\n</td>\n<td> <code>Traits</code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>ostream_type</code>\n</td>\n<td> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\"><span class=\"kw1732\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_ostream</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT, Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>value_type</code>\n</td>\n<td> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span></span></code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>difference_type</code>\n</td>\n<td> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span></span></code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>pointer</code>\n</td>\n<td> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span></span></code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>reference</code>\n</td>\n<td> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span></span></code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>iterator_category</code>\n</td>\n<td> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/iterator_tags\"><span class=\"kw658\">std::<span class=\"me2\">output_iterator_tag</span></span></a></span></code>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Member_functions\">Member functions</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/ostream_joiner/ostream_joiner\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(constructor)</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  constructs a new <code>ostream_joiner</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(destructor)</span></span></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark\">(implicitly declared)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  destructs an <code>ostream_joiner</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/ostream_joiner/operator=\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator=</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  writes an object to the associated output sequence <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/ostream_joiner/operator*\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator*</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  no-op <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/ostream_joiner/operator_arith\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator++</span><span>operator++<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(int)</span></span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  no-op <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Non-member_functions\">Non-member functions</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/ostream_joiner/make_ostream_joiner\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>make_ostream_joiner</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  creates an <code>ostream_joiner</code> object, deducing the template's type arguments from the function arguments <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;algorithm&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;experimental/iterator&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iterator&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> i<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">4</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">5</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/copy\"><span class=\"kw1594\">std::<span class=\"me2\">copy</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/begin\"><span class=\"kw681\">std::<span class=\"me2\">begin</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>i<span class=\"br0\">)</span>,\n              <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/end\"><span class=\"kw685\">std::<span class=\"me2\">end</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>i<span class=\"br0\">)</span>,\n              <a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/ostream_joiner/make_ostream_joiner\"><span class=\"kw2806\">std::<span class=\"me2\">experimental</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">make_ostream_joiner</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a>, <span class=\"st0\">\", \"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>1, 2, 3, 4, 5</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/ostreambuf_iterator\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>ostreambuf_iterator</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  output iterator that writes to <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_streambuf\">std::basic_streambuf</a></span> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/ostream_iterator\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>ostream_iterator</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  output iterator that writes to <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\">std::basic_ostream</a></span> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/istream_iterator\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>istream_iterator</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  input iterator that reads from <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_istream\">std::basic_istream</a></span> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Member types","id":"Member_types"},{"depth":3,"text":"Member functions","id":"Member_functions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Non-member functions","id":"Non-member_functions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"experimental","title":"Experimental C++ Features"}],"children":[{"path":"experimental/ostream_joiner/make_ostream_joiner","title":"std::experimental::make_ostream_joiner"},{"path":"experimental/ostream_joiner/operator*","title":"std::experimental::ostream_joiner<DelimT,CharT,Traits>::operator*"},{"path":"experimental/ostream_joiner/operator=","title":"std::experimental::ostream_joiner<DelimT,CharT,Traits>::operator="},{"path":"experimental/ostream_joiner/operator_arith","title":"std::experimental::ostream_joiner<DelimT,CharT,Traits>::operator++"},{"path":"experimental/ostream_joiner/ostream_joiner","title":"std::experimental::ostream_joiner<DelimT,CharT,Traits>::ostream_joiner"}],"map":{"label":"std::experimental::ostream_joiner","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. std::experimental::ostream_joiner is a single-pass LegacyOutputIterator that writes successive objects into the…"},{"label":"Member types","children":[{"label":"char_type","note":"CharT"},{"label":"traits_type","note":"Traits"},{"label":"ostream_type","note":"std::basic_ostream<CharT, Traits>"},{"label":"value_type","note":"void"},{"label":"difference_type","note":"void"},{"label":"pointer","note":"void"},{"label":"reference","note":"void"},{"label":"iterator_category","note":"std::output_iterator_tag"}]},{"label":"Member functions","children":[{"label":"(constructor)","note":"constructs a new ostream_joiner"},{"label":"(destructor)","note":"destructs an ostream_joiner"},{"label":"operator=","note":"writes an object to t